     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to work through the example of models without individual SNP-effects on the wiki. After running munge I get a matrix operation error when running ldsc:</div><div><br></div><div>Error in diag(Dvcovl) %*% vcor : non-conformable arguments<br></div><div><br></div><div>Using the master branch of Genomic SEM as of today.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Johan</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
