   "subject": "Re: Matrix operation error in ldsc",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Johan, <div><br></div><div>Can you post the code you ran? </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div> -Andrew</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Wednesday, March 25, 2020 at 7:47:08 AM UTC-5, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">johan.kallb...@kcl.ac.uk</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to work through the example of models without individual SNP-effects on the wiki. After running munge I get a matrix operation error when running ldsc:</div><div><br></div><div>Error in diag(Dvcovl) %*% vcor : non-conformable arguments<br></div><div><br></div><div>Using the master branch of Genomic SEM as of today.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Johan</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "_IRdX3UeBwAJ",
