   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Andrew,<div><br></div><div>Of course, here:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">nSampleMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">807553</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>munge</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  files</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data/PGC_UKB_depression_genome-wide_OR.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  hm3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data/w_hm3.noMHC.snplist&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#hapMap3/reference file</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  trait</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mdd&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nSampleMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  info</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">filter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#won&#39;t work without info</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  maf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">filter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#won&#39;t work without MAF</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>nCaseMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">246363</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#nControlMDD&lt;-561190</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>samplePrevMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nCaseMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nSampleMDD<br>popPrevMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">16</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>traits </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mdd.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prev </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">samplePrevMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>population</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prev </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">popPrevMDD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>ld </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;eur_w_ld_chr/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>wld </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;eur_w_ld_chr/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>trait</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MDD&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">LDSCoutput</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ldsc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">traits</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> population</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ld</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> wld</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> trait</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div>ldsc produces:</div><div><div><i>Read in summary statistics from mdd.sumstats.gz </i></div><div><i>Read in summary statistics for 1172490 SNPs </i></div><div><i>1161502 SNPs remaining after merging the files </i></div><div><i>Removed 0 SNPs with Chi^2 &gt; 807.553 (1161502 SNPs remain) </i></div><div><i>Results for trait mdd.sumstats.gz </i></div><div><i>Lambda GC: 1.4494 </i></div><div><i>Mean Chi^2: 1.5877 </i></div><div><i>Intercept: 0.9938(0.0103)</i></div><div><i>Ratio: -0.0105(0.0175)</i></div><div><i>h2: 0.0377 ( 0.0015 ) </i></div><div><i>elapsed </i></div><div><i> 32.697 </i></div></div></div></div>"
