e=\"color:#000\"><br>ld </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;eur_w_ld_chr/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>wld </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;eur_w_ld_chr/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>trait</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MDD&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">LDSCoutput</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ldsc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">traits</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> population</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ld</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> wld</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> trait</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div>ldsc produces:</div><div><div><i>Read in summary statistics from mdd.sumstats.gz </i></div><div><i>Read in summary statistics for 1172490 SNPs </i></div><div><i>1161502 SNPs remaining after merging the files </i></div><div><i>Removed 0 SNPs with Chi^2 &gt; 807.553 (1161502 SNPs remain) </i></div><div><i>Results for trait mdd.sumstats.gz </i></div><div><i>Lambda GC: 1.4494 </i></div><div><i>Mean Ch